### Internal working notes — not part of the shipped project ###
# Design docs, audits, handoffs and investigation write-ups live in the tree while work is in
# progress but are not published. These were previously covered only by .git/info/exclude, which
# is local to one clone: a fresh clone had no protection at all, so a stray `git add -A` would
# have committed them. Keep them here, where the rule travels with the repo.
AUDIT-*.md
*-AUDIT.md
*-HANDOFF.md
HANDOFF.md
*-BLUEPRINT.md
BLUEPRINT.md
*-PLAN.md
*-PHASING.md
*-PHASING-REVIEW.md
*-INVESTIGATION.md
*-RECONCILIATION.md
*-RESEARCH.md
*-SCOPE.md
*-DIAGNOSIS.md
*-PROMPT.md
*-DEEPDIVE.md
*-RESULT.md
*-RESULTS.md
*-notes.md
